# Factor IC Decay

When the user asks about factor IC decay, IC half-life, ICIR, predictive-power
fade, or whether a factor's IC is stable (因子IC衰减 / IC半衰期 / 因子稳不稳 /
预测力衰退 / 因子还能用多久), read
`.cursor/skills/factor-ic-decay/SKILL.md` and follow its workflow.

Read `.cursor/skills/factor-ic-decay/references/ic-methods.md` for method
definitions and `references/source_boundary.md` for evidence limits. Use
`scripts/ic_decay.py` for deterministic calculations. Always show the data
window, IC observation count, NW-t / ICIR, and half-life caveats; do not turn
decay diagnostics into a buy/sell signal.
